\r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 743 SE:\r\n— fleet: 2."},{"id":"regiment14-2","name":"2nd Fleet","legend":"Regiment was formed in 563 South Era during the Kevavian Expedition. 2nd Fleet is based in Rhaicie. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 743 SE:\r\n— fleet: 1."},{"id":"regiment15-0","name":"1st (Apjisatus) Regiment","legend":"Regiment was formed in 739 South Era during the Car'thas-Cakusian War. 1st (Apjisatus) Regiment is stationed in An'kagelash. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 743 SE:\r\n— infantry: 328\r\n— artillery: 22\r\n— cavalry: 29\r\n— archers: 319."},{"id":"regiment15-1","name":"1st Fleet","legend":"Regiment was formed in 587 South Era during the Cakus War. 1st Fleet is based in Nish. \r\n\r\nRegiment composition in 743 SE:\r\n— fleet: 4."},{"id":"marker0","name":"Slallen Creek of Luck","legend":"This legendary water source is whispered about in ancient tales and believed to possess mystical properties. The spring emanates crystal-clear water, shimmering with an otherworldly iridescence that sparkles even in the dimmest light."},{"id":"marker1","name":"Rral'eness — silver mining town","legend":"Rral'eness is a mining town of 307 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker2","name":"The Pink Panther","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious pan-fried panther with bright liquor is served here."},{"id":"marker3","name":"The Red Rat","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious spit-roasted bacon with light gin is served here."},{"id":"marker4","name":"The Lucky Hound","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dressed hound with pink sap is served here."},{"id":"marker5","name":"Rearesdonese Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker6","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=207793567127\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=207793567127\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker7","name":"Balboney Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 25 ft long."},{"id":"marker8","name":"Rhes'tex Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Arago (Arachnid) Druids."},{"id":"marker9","name":"Ialx Rats","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker10","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker11","name":"Veekzi Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ዘበዐበሀጰሐሠሰ ፐገ   ሀጸዘፈጠዐበገፈዘዐተጰዐጸሠ ሀዘቀበፀዘጠሀወጸሀከየዘሰ</div>"},{"id":"marker12","name":"Ruined Town","legend":"Ruins of an ancient town. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker13","name":"Herras Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker14","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker15","name":"Allintacha Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Allintacha, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker16","name":"Mooses migration","legend":"A huge group of mooses are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker17","name":"Ancient Rift","legend":"A rumoured ancient rift in this area is causing nearby plants to wither and decay."},{"id":"marker18","name":"Disturbed Burial","legend":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"id":"marker19","name":"Knutsterton Tomb","legend":"A sprawling necropolis built within a labyrinthine network of catacombs. Its halls are lined with countless alcoves, each housing the remains of the departed, while the distant sound of rattling bones fills the air."},{"id":"marker20","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/544\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"river6","name":"Dodbridbu River","legend":""},{"id":"river45","name":"Charton River","legend":""}]
